            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "2. Employees who, as of June 29, 2000, were paid at Step 7 on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-2 shall, effective June 30, 2000, be paid at a salary rate on the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-3 equal to that which the employee received on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-2. For the purposes outlined in Section 4 of this Article, said employees shall, upon conversion to the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-3, be provided with a date of next step increase in the next fiscal year which corresponds to the month and day on which the employee received his/her most recent step rate increase.",
