            "block_content": "4. Employees who, as of June 29, 2000, were paid at Steps 1, 2, 3, 4 or 5 on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-2 shall, effective June 30, 2000, be paid at a step on the salary schedule provided in Appendix B-3 which is next higher to the step which at least equals their June 29, 2000 salary rate on the salary schedule provided in Appendix A-2. The date of next step increase for said employees shall not be changed as a result of this conversion.",
