        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Employees who receive an “unsatisfactory” or “below” rating on their annual EPRS evaluation shall not be eligible to receive the salary increases or bonuses provided in Section 12.1 of this Article nor any step increases. Employees who receive an “unsatisfactory” or “below” rating will have their performance reviewed on a monthly basis in accordance with Article 24A and Supplemental Agreement III of this Agreement and will become eligible for the salary and step increase previously denied effective upon the date of receiving a “satisfactory”, “meets”, or “exceeds” rating.",
